# THE ONE MEASURED CHANGE (ADR-088 2-A-8 (a)): E runs at EVERY VALID CENTRE its stack holds,
# not at the fixed K_INFER = 42.  `n_all_centres` is the 1-B probe's helper verbatim and gives
# the same count section 2 scored the OOF with (62 on a full 64-slice stack, fewer on a short one).
def n_all_centres(mask, D):
    """Every window position the volume holds (I:99): the centres c in (lo, hi) of the valid range, T:204-205 / I:199-202."""
    valid = DEC["valid_slices"](mask, D)
    lo, hi = int(valid.min()), int(valid.max())
    return max(hi - lo - 1, 1)


